<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-GB">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f6f3eb">
    <title>Gourmet Crunch &amp; Glaze — a chef-led food concept</title>
    <meta name="description" content="A rustic, chef-led food concept exploring elevated soups, chicken meals, and honest customer feedback.">
    <style>
      :root {
        --ink: #25372c;
        --green: #405c49;
        --cream: #f6f3eb;
        --paper: #fffefa;
        --gold: #b78a50;
        --muted: #69736a;
        --line: #deded3;
        --serif: Georgia, serif;
        --sans: Arial, sans-serif;
      }

      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        background: var(--cream);
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: var(--sans);
        line-height: 1.5;
      }
      a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
      img { max-width: 100%; display: block; }
      .wrap {
        width: min(1100px, calc(100% - 32px));
        margin: 0 auto;
      }
      .top {
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(37, 55, 44, 0.2);
        background: rgba(246, 243, 235, 0.92);
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 20;
        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      }
      .nav {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        min-height: 72px;
        gap: 18px;
      }
      .brand {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      }
      .brandseal {
        width: 46px;
        height: 46px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        border: 1px solid var(--gold);
        background: #fff;
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      .brandname {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        line-height: 1.1;
      }
      .brandname small {
        color: var(--gold);
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-size: 0.58rem;
      }
      .nav-links {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: flex-end;
        gap: 18px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.92rem;
      }
      .cta {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 10px 16px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(183, 138, 80, 0.75);
        border-radius: 999px;
        color: var(--green);
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      .hero {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.18fr 0.82fr;
        gap: 34px;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 64px 0 32px;
      }
      .eyebrow {
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        color: var(--gold);
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }
      h1, h2, h3 {
        margin: 0 0 12px;
        font-family: var(--serif);
        line-height: 0.96;
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 5vw, 5rem);
      }
      h2 {
        font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 3vw, 3rem);
      }
      .hero p, .menu p, .story p, .feedback p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 1.02rem;
      }
      .hero-visual {
        min-height: 430px;
        border-radius: 26px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 16px 38px rgba(37, 55, 44, 0.12);
        background: #ddd;
      }
      .hero-visual img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
      }
      .menu {
        padding: 26px 0 12px;
      }
      .heading {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 20px;
        align-items: flex-end;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }
      .cards {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 18px;
      }
      .card {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
        border: 1px solid rgba(37, 55, 44, 0.08);
        border-radius: 22px;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .photo {
        height: 300px;
        background: #ddd;
      }
      .photo img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
      }
      .body {
        padding: 18px 18px 20px;
      }
      .body h3 {
        font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2vw, 2rem);
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }
      .body p {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.96rem;
      }
      .story {
        padding: 40px 0 64px;
      }
      .story-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
        gap: 26px;
        align-items: center;
      }
      .story-grid img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 420px;
        object-fit: cover;
        border-radius: 22px;
      }
      .feedback {
        background: #171614;
        color: #f4f0e8;
        padding: 54px 0;
      }
      .feedback .wrap {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
        gap: 24px;
        align-items: center;
      }
      .feedback p, .feedback .eyebrow {
        color: rgba(244, 240, 232, 0.8);
      }
      .feedback-box {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
        border-radius: 18px;
        padding: 18px;
      }
      .pill {
        display: inline-block;
        border: 1px solid rgba(243, 160, 0, 0.6);
        color: #ffbf5f;
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 8px 12px;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      footer {
        padding: 28px 0 50px;
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(37,55,44,0.12);
      }
      .foot { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      @media (max-width: 840px) {
        .hero, .cards, .story-grid, .feedback .wrap { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        .heading { align-items: flex-start; display: block; }
        .nav { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; padding: 12px 0; }
        .nav-links { width: 100%; justify-content: flex-start; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="top">
      <div class="wrap nav">
        <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="Gourmet Crunch and Glaze home">
          <span class="brandseal">GCG</span>
          <span class="brandname">Gourmet Crunch &amp; Glaze<small>Chef-led comfort</small></span>
        </a>
        <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Main navigation">
          <a href="#soups">Soups</a>
          <a href="#chicken">Chicken</a>
          <a href="#feedback">Feedback</a>
          <a href="#story">Story</a>
          <a class="cta" href="#feedback">Tell us what you think</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="top">
      <section class="wrap hero">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">A new kind of comfort</div>
          <h1>Rustic roots.<br><em>Engineered flavour.</em></h1>
          <p>A first look at Gourmet Crunch &amp; Glaze, a chef-led food concept built around comforting soups, elevated chicken plates, and a warm, honest hospitality story.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-visual">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1547592180-85f173990554?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="A rustic bowl of soup with herbs and warm ingredients">
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="wrap menu" id="soups">
        <div class="heading">
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow">A first taste</div>
            <h2>Three soups.<br>Which one calls to you?</h2>
          </div>
          <p>Inspired by slow-cooked comfort and refined flavour.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="cards">
          <article class="card">
            <div class="photo">
              <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1547592166-23ac45744acd?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="Ayrshire potato and garden leek soup with crisp croutons">
            </div>
            <div class="body">
              <h3>Ayrshire Leek</h3>
              <p>Silky potato, garden leek, and a savoury finish that feels at home in any season.</p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <div class="photo">
              <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1547592180-85f173990554?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="French onion soup crowned with toasted cheese croutons">
            </div>
            <div class="body">
              <h3>French Onion</h3>
              <p>Deep caramel notes, toasted cheese, and a rich broth shaped for slow, comforting evenings.</p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <div class="photo">
              <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504674900247-0877df9cc836?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="Crème de Barry cauliflower soup with croutons and chives">
            </div>
            <div class="body">
              <h3>Crème de Barry</h3>
              <p>Cauliflower, cream, and gentle herbs with a polished finish that feels elegant and familiar.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="wrap menu" id="chicken" style="padding-top: 0;">
        <div class="heading">
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow">The chicken lab</div>
            <h2>And a little more<br>than soup.</h2>
          </div>
          <p>Chicken meal concepts designed to feel substantial but still comforting.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="cards">
          <article class="card">
            <div class="photo">
              <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1604908176997-125f25cc6f3d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="Golden fried chicken with fresh sides">
            </div>
            <div class="body">
              <h3>Cruncher</h3>
              <p>Golden, crisp, and built for a hearty lunch that still feels premium.</p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <div class="photo">
              <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529042410759-befb1204b468?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="Balmoral-inspired chicken plate with herbs and potatoes">
            </div>
            <div class="body">
              <h3>Balmoral Roast</h3>
              <p>Herby, warm, and deeply comforting with a classic Scottish sensibility.</p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <div class="photo">
              <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559847844-5315695dadae?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="A modern chicken dish and sides in a stylish setting">
            </div>
            <div class="body">
              <h3>Modern Roast</h3>
              <p>Clean, bright, and stacked with texture for customers wanting something elevated.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="feedback" id="feedback">
        <div class="wrap">
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow">Your honest opinion</div>
            <h2>Would you<br>buy this?</h2>
            <p>We’re exploring whether these flavours and formats have enough pull to become a real food concept.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feedback-box">
            <div class="pill">Quick feedback</div>
            <p style="margin-top: 12px;">This concept works best when it feels grounded, seasonal, and easy to trust. A balanced menu, visible ingredients, and a clear food story make the difference.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="wrap story" id="story">
        <div class="story-grid">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1547592166-23ac45744acd?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=80" alt="A bowl of soup served with herbs and a warm, rustic finish.">
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow">The idea</div>
            <h2>Comfort food with a chef’s eye.</h2>
            <p>Gourmet Crunch &amp; Glaze is imagined as a warm, premium casual concept centred on honest ingredients and flavour-led execution. It blends traditional comfort with a little creative edge, giving customers the appeal of familiarity without losing character.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div class="wrap foot">
        <a class="brand" href="#top">
          <span class="brandseal">GCG</span>
          <span class="brandname">Gourmet Crunch &amp; Glaze<small>Chef-led comfort</small></span>
        </a>
        <span style="color: var(--muted);">Built for a warm, modern food concept.</span>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
